[ti:I’m]
[ar:言和]
[al:ELOHIM]
[by:RQvan]
[00:00.00]I’m
[00:02.00]
[00:04.00]曲：litterzy
[00:05.00]词：大九_LN
[00:06.00]调：litterzy
[00:07.00]绘：多尔及利亚
[00:08.00] 
[00:23.00]Conditional love on me
[00:26.20]Anachronistic ruling
[00:29.13]When shadows creep on the moon
[00:32.34]The true light can be seen

[00:35.00]A silhouette of belief
[00:37.86]I purl it on my skins
[00:41.01]Challenging what I can’t flee
[00:44.30]As a drop of sea

[00:47.22]Rebirth from the blind as I dreamed
[00:51.62]Thousands of years passed then
[00:54.96]Time to give a chance to your kid
[01:00.77]See with my eyes
[01:03.99]Instead of kneeling by your seat

[01:10.67]Sins grow upon the stalk
[01:13.60]Of lily as scars in black
[01:16.62]How can purity go back
[01:19.83]Via rusting tracks

[01:22.40]I’ve noticed all lies you made
[01:25.36]Illusional tricks you played
[01:28.63]So how can I just wait for one more day

[01:34.77]Rebirth from the deaf as I dreamed
[01:39.12]Thousands of years passed then
[01:42.26]Time to give a chance to your kid
[01:48.22]Hear with my ears
[01:51.78]Instead of losing in blank hymn
[01:58.98] 
[02:21.80]Retrieve my glory in grace
[02:26.53]Betrayal’s a few names
[02:29.69]One’s called being free from the past
[02:35.78]When I can’t say words entwined in my mind

[02:45.83]Rebirth from the death like you did
[02:50.14]Thousands of years waited then
[02:53.42]Time to give a chance to my soul
[02:59.38]Sing in my tone
[03:02.71]Instead of hiding my feelings
[03:10.05] 

[00:23.00]所获之爱附有条件
[00:26.20]不合时宜的统治
[00:29.13]当阴影爬上月亮
[00:32.34]真正的光芒才显现

[00:35.00]信仰的轮廓
[00:37.86]将它以反针织于皮肤
[00:41.01]挑战无法逃避之物
[00:44.30]如海中的一滴水

[00:47.22]从盲目中复生，如我曾梦见
[00:51.62]千年过去
[00:54.96]是时候给你的孩子机会
[01:00.77]用自己的眼睛看
[01:03.99]而非跪在你的座位旁

[01:10.67]罪孽攀缠于百合的茎
[01:13.60]如黑色瘢痕
[01:16.62]纯洁何以通过
[01:19.83]生锈的轨迹回归

[01:22.40]已注意到你的一切谎言
[01:25.36]你所玩的幻觉把戏
[01:28.63]那么我如何能多待一天

[01:34.77]从耳聋中复生，如我曾梦见
[01:39.12]千年过去
[01:42.26]是时候给你的孩子机会
[01:48.22]用自己的耳朵听
[01:51.78]而非迷失在空白的赞歌中
[01:58.98] 
[02:21.80]在恩典中找回我的荣耀
[02:26.53]背叛有多种名字
[02:29.69]其一叫作摆脱过去的自由
[02:35.78]在难言心中交织话语之时

[02:45.83]如你一般从死亡中复生
[02:50.14]已等待千年
[02:53.42]是时候给灵魂机会
[02:59.38]用我的曲调高唱
[03:02.71]而非一味隐藏感受
[03:10.05] 
